            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"1-whose-population-and-which-hospitals-are-missing\">1. Whose population, and which hospitals are missing</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Measure:</strong> Heart failure (HF) 30-Day Readmission Rate \u00b7 period 07/01/2023 to 06/30/2025</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Whose patients?</strong> The file does not say which patients are counted (age, insurance, diagnosis rules).\nThat lives in the measure definition on the CMS source page \u2014 <strong>check the measure definition</strong> and write\nwhat it says on your data card, with the link. Do not let an AI tool fill this in from memory.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Which hospitals?</strong> Of 5,419 hospitals in the general file, only <strong>3,253 (60%)</strong> have a number\nfor this measure. </span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='PKri-0' random-id='e2b477b7-4836-80b3-5c00-f9325c062493'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;step&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;Hospitals in CMS Hospital General Information&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;hospitals&#92;&quot;:5419},{&#92;&quot;step&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;&#92;&#92;u2026with a row for this measure&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;hospitals&#92;&quot;:4790},{&#92;&quot;step&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;&#92;&#92;u2026with a number for this measure&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;hospitals&#92;&quot;:3253}]&quot;' data-total-rows='3' data-total-columns='2' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-field-types='[[&quot;step&quot;,[&quot;string&quot;,&quot;str&quot;]],[&quot;hospitals&quot;,[&quot;integer&quot;,&quot;int64&quot;]]]' data-show-filters='true' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-