r? (at least three things)&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-debounce='true' data-full-width='true' data-rows='3'></marimo-text-area></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='BYtC-3' random-id='4be5182c-0e44-a22e-7cbe-f36dae0c7dfa'><marimo-text-area data-initial-value='&quot;&quot;' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eWho should use it, and for what decision? Who should not?&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-placeholder='&quot;&quot;' data-disabled='false' data-debounce='true' data-full-width='true' data-rows='2'></marimo-text-area></marimo-ui-element></div>"
