            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"before-you-submit\">Before you submit</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Deliverable:</strong> (1) your data card (what it can answer, for whom, what it cannot), and (2) a one-screen\nsketch of the app you will build \u2014 this page's box, a photo of a paper sketch, or a slide. Submit your AI\ntranscript with it.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>The one check to run:</strong> open the measure definition and confirm the patient population you wrote under\n\"For whom\". If you can't confirm it, write \"not confirmed\".</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Sign-off (write three lines in your submission):</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li><em>What I checked myself:</em> \u2026</li>\n<li><em>What I'm trusting the AI on:</em> \u2026</li>\n<li><em>What I won't sign:</em> \u2026</li>\n</ul></span>"
